","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101058","id":2569952352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZLlxg","user":{"login":"wareya","id":585488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/585488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya","html_url":"https://github.com/wareya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-04T00:10:03Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T00:10:03Z","body":"Using this code:\n\n```\nvar f := 0\nvar t := 0.0\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n    f += 1\n    t += delta\n    if t > 5.0:\n        $\"../Label\".text = str(round(f/t*100)/100)\n        t = 0.0\n        f = 0\n```\n\nThe reported framerate is ~144 with `low_processor_mode` enabled, and with it disabled, it's... 120? That's not right! My monitor is 240hz. If I then move the window to my second monitor, which is 144hz, it reports 240fps, which is still wrong. Vsync seems to be somehow using vsync timing from the wrong monitor!\n\nIn the case where it reports 240fps, the CPU usage is still lower than what it reports in low processor usage mode:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d1e25ac-61b9-4f5b-a5ad-a0afdb12e2f1)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569952352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]